{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34460","headline":"和袭美伤开元观顾道士 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美伤开元观顾道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事神超入杳冥，不骑孤鹤上三清。\n多应白简迎将去，即是朱陵链更生。\n药奠肯同椒醑味，云谣空替薤歌声。\n武皇徒有飘飘思，谁问山中宰相名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}